<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Kubernetes Lab 3 — Multi-Tenancy with Namespaces</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #0d1117;
      color: #c9d1d9;
      line-height: 1.7;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* HEADER */
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 48px 0 40px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e6edf3;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .badges {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .badge-k8s  { background: #1a2f5e; color: #58a6ff; border: 1px solid #1f6feb; }
    .badge-done { background: #0f2a1a; color: #3fb950; border: 1px solid #238636; }
    .badge-ns   { background: #1c1f2e; color: #a5b4fc; border: 1px solid #4f46e5; }

    /* SECTIONS */
    section { margin-bottom: 44px; }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e6edf3;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #cdd9e5;
      margin: 20px 0 10px;
    }

    p { color: #8b949e; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    p strong { color: #c9d1d9; }

    /* ARCHITECTURE BOX */
    .arch-box {
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", monospace;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #8b949e;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .arch-box .ns-label { color: #58a6ff; font-weight: 600; }
    .arch-box .res-label { color: #3fb950; }

    /* TABLE */
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    thead tr { background: #161b22; }
    th {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      color: #8b949e;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
    }
    td {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;
      color: #c9d1d9;
    }
    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    tr:hover td { background: #161b22; }

    code {
      background: #21262d;
      color: #79c0ff;
      padding: 2px 7px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-family: "SF Mono", monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* CHECKLIST */
    .checklist { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
    .checklist li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      color: #c9d1d9;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #161b22;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .check-icon { color: #3fb950; font-size: 16px; }

    /* CODE BLOCKS */
    pre {
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 12px 0;
      position: relative;
    }

    pre code {
      background: none;
      color: #e6edf3;
      padding: 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .cmd-comment { color: #6e7681; }
    .cmd-kubectl  { color: #79c0ff; }
    .cmd-flag     { color: #ffab70; }
    .cmd-value    { color: #a5d6ff; }

    /* SCREENSHOT CARDS */
    .screenshot-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .screenshot-card {
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .screenshot-card .card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      background: #1c2128;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d;
    }

    .card-num {
      width: 26px; height: 26px;
      background: #1f6feb;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }

    .card-title { color: #e6edf3; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }

    .screenshot-card .card-body { padding: 20px; }

    .screenshot-placeholder {
      background: #0d1117;
      border: 2px dashed #30363d;
      border-radius: 8px;
      height: 180px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: #484f58;
    }

    .screenshot-placeholder .ph-icon { font-size: 32px; }
    .screenshot-placeholder .ph-text { font-size: 13px; }

    .card-caption {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #6e7681;
      font-style: italic;
      padding-left: 4px;
    }

    /* CONCEPTS CARDS */
    .concepts-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .concept-card {
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    .concept-card .cc-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #58a6ff;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .concept-card .cc-desc {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #8b949e;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* AUTHOR */
    .author-card {
      background: #161b22;
      border: 1px solid #30363d;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .author-avatar {
      width: 52px; height: 52px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f6feb, #388bfd);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 22px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .author-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #e6edf3; }
    .author-role { font-size: 13px; color: #8b949e; margin-top: 3px; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .concepts-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .header h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <h1>☸️ Kubernetes Lab 3<br>Multi-Tenancy with Namespaces</h1>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="badge badge-k8s">☸️ Kubernetes</span>
      <span class="badge badge-done">✔ Completed</span>
      <span class="badge badge-ns">⬡ 2 Namespaces</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- OBJECTIVE -->
  <section>
    <h2>📋 Objective</h2>
    <p>
      Demonstrate <strong>namespace isolation</strong> and <strong>internal service communication</strong>
      in a Kubernetes cluster by deploying isolated environments that simulate real-world multi-tenant setups.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ARCHITECTURE -->
  <section>
    <h2>🏗️ Architecture Overview</h2>
    <div class="arch-box">
      Kubernetes Cluster<br>
      ├── Namespace: <span class="ns-label">dev</span><br>
      │&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── <span class="res-label">Pod:</span> backend-pod<br>
      │&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── <span class="res-label">Service:</span> backend-svc<br>
      │&nbsp;&nbsp; └── <span class="res-label">Pod:</span> frontend-pod<br>
      │<br>
      └── Namespace: <span class="ns-label">staging</span><br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── <span class="res-label">Pod:</span> backend-pod<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ├── <span class="res-label">Service:</span> backend-svc<br>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; └── <span class="res-label">Pod:</span> frontend-pod
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ENVIRONMENTS -->
  <section>
    <h2>🌍 Environments</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Namespace</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>dev</code></td><td>Active development environment</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>staging</code></td><td>Pre-production testing environment</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <h3>Each environment contains:</h3>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li><span class="check-icon">✅</span> <strong>backend-pod</strong> — Backend application pod</li>
      <li><span class="check-icon">✅</span> <strong>backend-svc</strong> — Internal ClusterIP service</li>
      <li><span class="check-icon">✅</span> <strong>frontend-pod</strong> — Frontend application pod</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- VERIFICATION -->
  <section>
    <h2>✅ Verification</h2>
    <h3>Check resources in <code>dev</code></h3>
    <pre><code><span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> get pods,svc <span class="cmd-flag">-n</span> <span class="cmd-value">dev</span></code></pre>
    <h3>Check resources in <code>staging</code></h3>
    <pre><code><span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> get pods,svc <span class="cmd-flag">-n</span> <span class="cmd-value">staging</span></code></pre>
  </section>

  <!-- ACCESS -->
  <section>
    <h2>🌐 Access the Application</h2>
    <p>Forward the frontend pod port to your local machine:</p>
    <pre><code><span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> port-forward pod/frontend-pod <span class="cmd-value">8082:80</span> <span class="cmd-flag">-n</span> <span class="cmd-value">dev</span></code></pre>
    <p>Then open your browser at:</p>
    <pre><code><span class="cmd-value">http://localhost:8082</span></code></pre>
  </section>

  <!-- SCREENSHOTS -->
  <section>
    <h2>📸 Screenshots</h2>
    <div class="screenshot-grid">

      <div class="screenshot-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-num">1</div>
          <span class="card-title">Running Pods &amp; Services — <code>dev</code> Namespace</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="screenshot-placeholder">
            <span class="ph-icon">🖼️</span>
            <span class="ph-text">screenshots/dev-namespace.png</span>
          </div>
          <p class="card-caption">Output of <code>kubectl get pods,svc -n dev</code> — all resources in Running state.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="screenshot-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-num">2</div>
          <span class="card-title">Running Pods &amp; Services — <code>staging</code> Namespace</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="screenshot-placeholder">
            <span class="ph-icon">🖼️</span>
            <span class="ph-text">screenshots/staging-namespace.png</span>
          </div>
          <p class="card-caption">Output of <code>kubectl get pods,svc -n staging</code> — all resources in Running state.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="screenshot-card">
        <div class="card-header">
          <div class="card-num">3</div>
          <span class="card-title">Browser Output After Port-Forward</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="screenshot-placeholder">
            <span class="ph-icon">🌐</span>
            <span class="ph-text">screenshots/browser-output.png</span>
          </div>
          <p class="card-caption">Frontend accessible at <code>http://localhost:8082</code> via <code>kubectl port-forward</code>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KEY CONCEPTS -->
  <section>
    <h2>💡 Key Concepts Demonstrated</h2>
    <div class="concepts-grid">
      <div class="concept-card">
        <div class="cc-title">🔒 Namespace Isolation</div>
        <div class="cc-desc">Resources in <code>dev</code> are fully isolated from <code>staging</code></div>
      </div>
      <div class="concept-card">
        <div class="cc-title">🔗 Internal Communication</div>
        <div class="cc-desc">Pods communicate via ClusterIP services within the same namespace</div>
      </div>
      <div class="concept-card">
        <div class="cc-title">🚇 Port Forwarding</div>
        <div class="cc-desc">Local access to cluster pods without exposing external endpoints</div>
      </div>
      <div class="concept-card">
        <div class="cc-title">🏢 Multi-Tenancy</div>
        <div class="cc-desc">Multiple teams share a single cluster with logical separation</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- USEFUL COMMANDS -->
  <section>
    <h2>🔑 Useful Commands</h2>
    <pre><code><span class="cmd-comment"># List all namespaces</span>
<span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> get namespaces

<span class="cmd-comment"># View all resources across all namespaces</span>
<span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> get all <span class="cmd-flag">--all-namespaces</span>

<span class="cmd-comment"># Describe a pod in dev</span>
<span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> describe pod frontend-pod <span class="cmd-flag">-n</span> <span class="cmd-value">dev</span>

<span class="cmd-comment"># View pod logs</span>
<span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> logs frontend-pod <span class="cmd-flag">-n</span> <span class="cmd-value">dev</span>

<span class="cmd-comment"># Delete all resources in a namespace</span>
<span class="cmd-kubectl">kubectl</span> delete all <span class="cmd-flag">--all -n</span> <span class="cmd-value">dev</span></code></pre>
  </section>

  <!-- AUTHOR -->
  <section>
    <h2>👤 Author</h2>
    <div class="author-card">
      <div class="author-avatar">👨‍💻</div>
      <div>
        <div class="author-name">Moamen</div>
        <div class="author-role">DevOps Engineer — Kubernetes & DevSecOps Learning Path</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</body>
</html>
